# "This creature enters tapped" (CR 614.1d): Diregraf Ghoul (2/2) is on the battlefield tapped the turn it is cast, so it is untapped
# and attacks on turn 3 for 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Diregraf Ghoul
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Diregraf Ghoul.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Diregraf Ghoul.Tapped = true
